'''Guesting''' is a feature that allows players to visit islands of other players.

== Mechanics ==
While guesting, most item abilities such as the {{Item|Aspect of the End}}'s teleport and {{Item|Ember Rod}}'s fireball are disabled. Some items like the {{Item|Grappling Hook}} are exceptions to this.
