You can purchase guest limit upgrades at {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}}. The first additional slot is free, but the next {{Green|4}} upgrades each cost {{Gems|50}}.

'''Note:''' {{RN|MVP++}} can bypass the guesting limit, but only {{Green|10}} above the normal limit. If you are in a [[Co-op]], your guesting limit is that of the player with the highest rank.

=== Commands ===
There are various [[Commands]] that a player can use for guesting:
* To visit another player: <code>/visit (In Game Name)</code>
* To invite someone to guest to your island: <code>/invite (In Game Name)</code>.
Players talking in chat while guesting will have their messages prefaced with a {{Green|[✌]}} symbol.

== Interface ==
Guesting setting can be found in [[SkyBlock Menu]] → [[Settings]] → Guest Management.
